    },
    "message": "Let plain resource losses run without operational event state\n\nThe per-tick operational check required operational_events_v1 state\nwhenever a resource_loss (or other plain ledger event) was pending, but\nthe state is only created for H03 events and shipment deliveries, and\nthe full check accepts its absence in the same case. A generated\nScenario with a resource_loss condition stopped at its first tick.\nThe per-tick check now uses the same uses_operational_events rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
